      "note": "Weekly in March from Tuesday 3 March 2026 at 23:30 UTC, to Berlin, where the start is Wednesday 00:30: BYMONTH=3 only limits the months, so the days follow the start. As they fall now is refused, as series_shift refuses moving the days of a rule limited to months, so the editors ask. As the rule says the start moves back onto Tuesday, 00:30 Berlin, and the deletion on Tuesday 9 March 2027 moves with its occurrence to Tuesday 00:30 Berlin.",
